('cb0ce15d-83ea-471c-aeb5-f1c70c1f575c', 'Band Baza', 'Book Band Baza DJ service from Vivah Bazaar, Prices starts from ₹24999', '<p data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"130\">🥁 <strong data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"128\">Band Baja DJ Service &ndash; Starting from ₹9,999</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"407\">शादी की बारात का असली मज़ा होता है <em data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"180\">Band aur DJ</em> के साथ। ढोल&ndash;नगाड़ों की गूंज और DJ की धुनें barat ko बना देती हैं <em data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"267\">full on dhamakedaar</em>। Vivah Bazaar का Band Baja DJ Package आपके event ko देता है <em data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"371\">traditional band ke saath modern DJ beats</em> &ndash; ताकि हर age group enjoy कर सके।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"442\">✨ <strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"440\">इस पैकेज में आपको मिलेगा:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n<li data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"488\">Band Baja DJ Service सिर्फ ₹9,999 से शुरू</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"554\">\r\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"554\">Professional band team with dhol, nagada, trumpet aur shehnai</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"604\">\r\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"604\">DJ system with sound, lights aur latest songs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<p data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"657\">Barat aur Dulha entry ke लिए special performance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"728\">Customized package &ndash; सिर्फ band / सिर्फ DJ / या दोनों combo option</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"786\">📌 <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"784\">क्यों चुनें Vivah Bazaar Band Baja DJ Services?</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n<li data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"825\">Affordable pricing सिर्फ ₹9,999 से</p