('dae15fc7-2162-46bd-a77b-931fa7434f23', 'Camera', 'Easily book DSLR, mirrorless, and professional cameras online for weddings and special occasions with transparent pricing, real-time availability, and doorstep delivery', '<h3 data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"221\">Camera Booking &amp; Photography Services for Weddings &amp; Events</h3>\n<p data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"495\">Make every moment of your wedding and special occasions unforgettable with our <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"358\">professional camera booking and photography services</strong>. From traditional photography to cinematic video shoots, we provide everything you need to capture memories in the most beautiful way.</p>\n<h4 data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"522\">Services Available</h4>\n<ul data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"964\">\n<li data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"603\">\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"603\">📸 <strong data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"549\">Still Photography</strong> &ndash; High-quality photographs to capture every detail.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"671\">\n<p data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"671\">🎥 <strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"624\">Videography</strong> &ndash; Professional video coverage of your event.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"744\">\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"744\">🎬 <strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"697\">Cinematic Shoots</strong> &ndash; Movie-style storytelling for your big day.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"816\">\n<p data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"816\">🎞 <strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"772\">4K Video Recording</strong> &ndash; Ultra HD clarity for timeless memories.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"886\">\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"886\">🚁 <strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"838\">Drone Shoots</strong> &ndash; Stunning aerial views to add a grand touch.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"964\">\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"964\">💑 <strong data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"914\">Pre-Wedding Shoots</strong> &ndash; Creative and personalized themes for couples.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"987\">Why Choose Us?</h4>\n<ul data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1349\">\n<li data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1042\">\n<p data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1042\">✅ Wide range of DSLR, Mirrorless &amp; Cinema Cameras.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1105\">\n<p data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1105\">✅ Experienced professionals for photography &amp; videography.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1155\">\n<p data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1155\">✅ Transparent pricing with no hidden charges.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1203\">\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1203\">✅ Real-time availability &amp; instant booking.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1252\">\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1252\">✅ Doorstep delivery and easy pickup options.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1301\">\n<p data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1301\">✅ Well-maintained equipment and accessories.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1349\">\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1349\">✅ Customer support throughout your booking.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1370\">How It Works</h4>\n<ol data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1674\">\n<li data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1436\">\n<p data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1436\">Choose the service and camera package that suits your event.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1490\">\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1490\">Select booking date &amp; confirm your order online.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1560\">\n<p data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1560\">Get doorstep delivery of equipment or professional team support.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1625\">\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1625\">Enjoy your event while we capture every moment beautifully.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1674\">\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1674\">Easy pickup and hassle-free return process.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\nCamera Booking & Photography Services for Weddings & Events\n\nMake every moment of your wedding and special occasions unforgettable with our professional camera booking and photography services. From traditional photography to cinematic video shoots, we provide everything you need to capture memories in the most beautiful way.\n\nServices Available\n\n📸 Still Photography – High-quality photographs to capture every detail.\n\n \n\n\n🎥 Videography – Professional video coverage of your event.\n\n\n\n\n🎬 Cinematic Shoots – Movie-style storytelling for your big day.\n\n\n\n\n🎞 4K Video Recording – Ultra HD clarity for timeless memories.\n\n\n\n\n🚁 Drone Shoots – Stunning aerial views to add a grand touch.\n\n\n\n\n💑 Pre-Wedding Shoots – Creative and personalized themes for couples.\n\n\n\n\nWhy Choose Us?\n\n✅ Wide range of DSLR, Mirrorless & Cinema Cameras.\n\n✅ Experienced professionals for photography & videography.\n\n✅ Transparent pricing with no hidden charges.\n\n✅ Real-time availability & instant booking.\n\n✅ Doorstep delivery and easy pickup options.\n\n✅ Well-maintained equipment and accessories.\n\n✅ Customer support throughout your booking.\n\nHow It Works\n\nChoose the service and camera package that suits your event.\n\nSelect booking date & confirm your order online.\n\nGet doorstep delivery of equipment or professional team support.\n\nEnjoy your event while we capture every moment beautifully.\n\nEasy pickup and hassle-free return process.\n\n✨ With our photography, videography, cinematic shoots, and drone services, your wedding and events will be remembered forever in the most elegant way.', '2025-08-28-68b067ef23a7c.png', '2025-08-28-68b067ef241e4.png', '2ebcfcc9-3a6b-4a4d-826e-da2132e2a147', '615c8065-dd18-49ab-984d-d92ea99e2169', 1.000, 0, 1, 0, 0.0000, 100.000, '2025-09-07 23:16:00', '2025-08-28 20:00:07', '2025-09-07 23:16:00'),
('e953d1cb-ca4d-4119-8ff7-4a1095a56b29', 'Basic Makeup', 'Book Basic Makeup service from Vivah Bazaar, Prices starts from ₹1599', '<p data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"169\">💄 <strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"167\">Basic Makeup Service &ndash; Starting from ₹1,599</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"377\">हर दुल्हन का सपना होता है कि उसकी शादी के दिन वह सबसे सुंदर और आकर्षक दिखे। Vivah Bazaar का Basic Makeup Package आपको देता है <em data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"323\">natural aur elegant look</em>, ताकि आप शादी के दिन चमकें और हर नजर आप पर ठहर जाए।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"412\">✨ <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"410\">इस पैकेज में आपको मिलेगा:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<li data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"457\">\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"457\">Basic Bridal Makeup सिर्फ ₹<strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"167\">1,599</strong> से शुरू</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"521\">Professional makeup artist aur branded products का इस्तेमाल</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"563\">\r\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"563\">Natural look with long-lasting makeup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"608\">Hair styling aur basic accessories setup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<p data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"655\">Pre-makeup skin care aur touch-up facility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"713\">📌 <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"711\">क्यों चुनें Vivah Bazaar Basic Makeup Services?</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"912\">\r\n<li data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"752\">Affordable pricing सिर्फ ₹<strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"167\">1,599 </strong>से</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"808\">Experienced makeup artists with professional skills</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"854\">Branded aur skin-friendly products का use</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"912\">\r\n<p data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"912\">Time par service aur client satisfaction की guarantee</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1047\">💍 शादी हर लड़की के लिए <em data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"963\">ज़िंदगी का सबसे खास दिन</em> होता है। हमारा Basic Makeup Package आपके इस दिन को और भी खास aur यादगार बना देगा।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1129\">👉 अभी बुक करें और अपने wedding look को दें <em data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1126\">simple, elegant aur royal touch</em>!</p>', '2025-09-11-68c28e0e40cf0.png', '2025-09-11-68c28e0e4131d.png', '212c0837-db27-4833-b524-cb4ad5e17b31', '34f2a90d-43a5-4f46-8c82-2717d3804018', 5.000, 0, 1, 0, 0.0000, 1599.000, NULL, '2025-09-11 14:23:34', '2025-09-11 14:29:11'),
('ed67d592-05bd-4343-80ae-672f57ee0d7f', 'Bridal Makeup', 'Book Bridal Makeup service from Vivah Bazaar, Prices starts from ₹7499', '<p data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"121\">💍 <strong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"119\">Bridal Makeup Service &ndash; Starting from ₹7,499</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"329\">हर दुल्हन का सपना होता है कि शादी के दिन वह सबसे खूबसूरत और <em data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"190\">royal</em> दिखे। Vivah Bazaar का Bridal Makeup Package आपको देता है <em data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"292\">flawless, elegant aur picture-perfect look</em>, ताकि हर नजर सिर्फ आप पर टिकी रहे।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"364\">✨ <strong data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"362\">इस पैकेज में आपको मिलेगा:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"651\">\r\n<li data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"403\">\r\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"403\">Bridal Makeup सिर्फ ₹7,499 से शुरू</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"475\">Professional bridal makeup artists aur branded products का इस्तेमाल</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"535\">\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"535\">Customized bridal look &ndash; Traditional, Modern, Glamorous</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<p data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"590\">Bridal hair styling aur accessories setup included</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"651\">\r\n<p data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"651\">Long-lasting aur skin-friendly products jo पूरे दिन टिके</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"710\">📌 <strong data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"708\">क्यों चुनें Vivah Bazaar Bridal Makeup Services?</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<li data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"749\">Affordable pricing सिर्फ ₹7,499 से</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"799\">Experienced aur trained bridal makeup artists</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"846\">\r\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"846\">Premium quality aur skin-friendly products</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"916\">Customized makeover jo आपकी personality aur dress ke साथ match हो</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"974\">Timely service aur 100% client satisfaction guarantee</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1136\">💍 आपकी शादी ज़िंदगी का सबसे खास दिन है। हमारा Bridal Makeup Package आपके look ko बनाएगा <em data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1093\">royal, graceful aur यादगार</em>, ताकि हर photo और हर memory perfect लगे।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1212\">👉 अभी बुक करें और अपनी shaadi ke दिन ko दें एक <em data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1209\">flawless bridal touch</em>!</p>', '2025-09-11-68c28fc9e9a94.png', '2025-09-11-68c28fc9ea478.png', '212c0837-db27-4833-b524-cb4ad5e17b31', '4741ca22-4ba3-4ee5-819e-8b329b97a1e9', 5.000, 0, 1, 0, 0.0000, 7499.000, NULL, '2025-09-11 14:30:57', '2025-09-11 14:30:57'),
('f4d44b69-9b28-4c3c-8956-1c223367dd3a', 'Test Service', 'This is a fake short description for the test service.', '<p>This is a fake long description for test service. In the real service, valid informations will be given here.</p>', '2023-08-31-64ef3a3e696a2.png', '2023-08-31-64ef3a3e6d6c0.png', '5e5c0fdb-9ad7-4075-bcc1-d7523efde8c6', 'b4fcd6d4-ba80-4e20-9ee2-f07a8b1466c6', 10.000, 0, 1, 0, 0.0000, 97.000, '2025-08-28 14:43:15', '2023-08-30 19:46:54', '2025-08-28 14:43:15'),
('f5c493cc-cd84-4da0-b7d8-45bbbbb744bc', 'Gate Decoration', 'Book Gate Decoration service from Vivah Bazaar, Prices starts from ₹9999', '<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"133\">🎉 <strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"131\">Gate Decoration &ndash; Starting from ₹9,999</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"406\">शादी का पहला impression होता है <em data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"184\">Gate Decoration</em>। जब मेहमान आपके शादी स्थल पर आते हैं, तो सबसे पहले उनकी नजर गेट की सजावट पर ही पड़ती है। Vivah Bazaar का Gate Decoration Package आपके shaadi के gate ko बनाता है <em data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"374\">grand, royal aur welcoming</em>, जिससे हर guest impressed हो।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"441\">✨ <strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"439\">इस पैकेज में आपको मिलेगा:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<li data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"482\">\r\n<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"482\">Gate Decoration सिर्फ ₹9,999 से शुरू</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"545\">Fresh flowers, decorative lights aur designer fabric setup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"609\">Multiple themes &ndash; Traditional, Modern, Royal aur Customized</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"659\">\r\n<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"659\">Wide entry arches aur designer welcome boards</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"716\">Professional decorators aur time par setup की सुविधा</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"777\">📌 <strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"775\">क्यों चुनें Vivah Bazaar Gate Decoration Services?</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<li data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"816\">Affordable pricing सिर्फ ₹9,999 से</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"864\">\r\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"864\">Grand aur stylish सजावट जो सबको attract करे</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"914\">\r\n<p data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"914\">Fresh flowers aur premium decoration material</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"969\">Customized designs aur timely service की guarantee</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1093\">💍 शादी का gate ही आपके celebration का पहला look होता है, और हमारी सजावट आपके event ko aur भी royal aur यादगार बना देगी।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1180\">👉 अभी बुक करें और अपनी shaadi ke entry gate को दें grand aur royal सजावट का touch!</p>', '2025-09-11-68c27f39ba6ce.png', '2025-09-11-68c27f39badfd.png', 'c64e2b61-1986-4fa8-b4b8-82cbde1025d9', '6742b5bd-1bba-4798-9dbb-c61427e34ac2', 5.000, 0, 1, 0, 0.0000, 9999.000, NULL, '2025-09-11 13:20:17', '2025-09-11 13:20:17'),
('fc46e3ca-9dfd-447a-97aa-5fa82d89a7be', 'Car Bookin', 'Book wedding cars, cabs, and buses easily online – from Dulha Gadi to luxury buses. Affordable rates, transparent pricing, and fuel extra', '<h3 data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"381\">Vehicle Booking Service for Weddings &amp; Events</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"618\">Make your wedding or special event memorable with our <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"485\">reliable and stylish vehicle booking service</strong>. From traditional <strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"518\">Dulha Gadi</strong> to comfortable cabs and spacious buses, we provide a wide range of vehicles at affordable prices.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"655\">Available Vehicles &amp; Pricing</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<li data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"717\">🚗 <strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"689\">Dulha Gadi (Wedding Car)</strong> &ndash; ₹3299 (Half Day) + Fuel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"759\">🚙 <strong data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"734\">Scorpio</strong> &ndash; ₹1299 per day + Fuel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"800\">🚙 <strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"775\">Bolero</strong> &ndash; ₹1199 per day + Fuel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"854\">🚕 <strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"829\">Cab (Sedan/Compact)</strong> &ndash; ₹1199 per day + Fuel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"894\">\r\n<p data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"894\">🚘 <strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"869\">Dzire</strong> &ndash; ₹3299 per day + Fuel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"954\">\r\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"954\">🚌 <strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"907\">Bus</strong> &ndash; ₹19,999 to ₹24,999 (Depending on distance)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"977\">Why Choose Us?</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<li data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1031\">\r\n<p data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1031\">✅ Wide range of vehicles for every budget &amp; need.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1101\">✅ Perfect for <strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1098\">Dulha entry, family travel, or guest transport</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1158\">✅ Transparent pricing &ndash; only pay for vehicle + fuel.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1216\">✅ Well-maintained, clean, and decorated (on request).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1267\">✅ Experienced drivers for safe &amp; smooth rides.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1318\">✅ Easy online booking and timely availability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1339\">How It Works</h4>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1415\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1415\">Select your vehicle according to your need (wedding car, cab, or bus).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1467\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1467\">Choose booking duration (half day / full day).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1504\">Confirm your booking instantly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1555\">Vehicle arrives at your doorstep with driver.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1609\">Enjoy a hassle-free ride with comfort and style.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1763\">✨ Whether it&rsquo;s a <strong data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1686\">grand Dulha entry, family trip, or transporting guests</strong>, our vehicles ensure <strong data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1743\">comfort, style, and reliability</strong> for your big day.</p>', '2025-08-29-68b148e353bc8.png', '2025-08-29-68b148e35427d.png', '92f88afa-be2a-49eb-bee6-da7251523879', 'b2d89bf1-61ca-4237-acf0-a3dcdbd7289d', 1.000, 0, 1, 0, 0.0000, 1199.000, '2025-08-29 12:07:30', '2025-08-29 11:59:55', '2025-08-29 12:07:30'),
('fce7d36d-5939-4e02-97b9-38e5a6f50095', '4k Video', 'Book 4k Video Shooting from Vivah Bazaar, Prices starts from ₹6999 per day', '<h3 data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"356\">🎥 4K Video Shooting &ndash; Starting from ₹6,999/day</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"792\">आपकी शादी के हर खास पल को अब और भी बेहतरीन तरीके से capture किया जाएगा <strong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"452\">4K Ultra HD quality</strong> के साथ। Vivah Bazaar का <strong data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"506\">4K Video Shooting Package</strong> आपकी shaadi को ekdum cinematic look deta hai &ndash; jisme har ek detail, har emotion aur har ritual ekदम real aur memorable ban jaata hai। हमारी प्रोफेशनल टीम latest 4K cameras aur advanced technology ke saath shoot karti hai taaki आपकी wedding videos life-time ke liye treasure ban जाएँ।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"823\">✨ इस पैकेज में आपको मिलेगा:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<li data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"873\">\r\n<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"873\">पूरे दिन की 4K coverage (₹6,999/day से शुरू)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"921\">\r\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"921\">Experienced videographers की dedicated team</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"966\">\r\n<p data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"966\">Multiple camera angles + cinematic shots</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1030\">Drone shots* और crystal-clear sound के साथ premium shooting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1090\">Professionally edited wedding highlights + full 4K film</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1141\">आपके अनुसार customization और add-ons की सुविधा</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1330\">चाहे varmala की grand entry हो, mehendi की masti, doston ke dance performances ya bidaai ke emotional moments &ndash; हमारी टीम हर scene को ek <strong data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1301\">blockbuster movie</strong> ki tarah record karti hai।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1389\">📌 क्यों चुनें Vivah Bazaar 4K Video Shooting Services?</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1597\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1433\">Affordable pricing सिर्फ ₹6,999/day से</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1485\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1485\">100+ successful wedding video projects का अनुभव</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1541\">Creative cinematic storytelling + traditional touch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1597\">Timely delivery और client satisfaction की guarantee</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1741\">💍 आपकी shaadi ज़िंदगी का सबसे बड़ा celebration है, और हमारी responsibility है कि हम हर पल को ek <strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1728\">beautiful 4K cinematic story</strong> में बदलें।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1813\">👉 अभी बुक करें aur अपनी wedding ko ek blockbuster 4K film bana लें!</p>', '2025-09-07-68bdcb898ce84.png', '2025-09-07-68bdcb898d6a7.png', 'daa6059b-874b-4117-9447-601638959295', 'c942f725-5192-44c6-9d7a-03226f1bc857', 5.000, 0, 1, 0, 0.0000, 6999.000, NULL, '2025-09-07 23:44:33', '2025-09-07 23:44:33');
