(45, 'Modules\\ServiceManagement\\Entities\\Service', '5e90d700-2418-4ada-af0f-b42fbecdf6f2', 'en', 'description', '<h3 data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"208\">🎬 Cinematic Shoot &ndash; Starting from ₹9,999/day</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"658\">आपकी शादी सिर्फ एक celebration नहीं बल्कि एक <strong data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"270\">grand story</strong> है, जिसे हम cinematic style में capture करते हैं। Vivah Bazaar का <strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"364\">Cinematic Shoot Package</strong> आपके हर पल को film-like experience deta hai &ndash; jisme slow-motion shots, creative angles aur artistic editing se आपकी shaadi ek <strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"512\">blockbuster movie</strong> ban जाती है। हमारी प्रोफेशनल टीम latest cinematic cameras aur advanced equipment ke saath काम करती है ताकि हर frame ekदम royal aur elegant लगे।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"689\">✨ इस पैकेज में आपको मिलेगा:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<li data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"746\">पूरे दिन की cinematic coverage (₹9,999/day से शुरू)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"805\">Professional cinematic videographers की dedicated team</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"873\">\r\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"873\">Creative shots with slow-motion, transitions &amp; cinematic frames</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"930\">\r\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"930\">Drone shots* और multi-camera setup for grand visuals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"992\">\r\n<p data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"992\">Professionally edited cinematic wedding film + highlights</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1044\">आपके अनुसार customization aur add-ons ki सुविधा</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1242\">चाहे varmala की entry ho, bride-groom ke