(77, 'Modules\\ServiceManagement\\Entities\\Service', '439e1e8f-de53-4368-90f5-75c3d9cdc52c', 'en', 'description', '<p data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"279\">🚗 <strong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"277\">Dulha Car &ndash; Starting from ₹3,299 (Half Day + Fuel)</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"606\">शादी के दिन दूल्हे की entry हमेशा royal aur stylish होनी चाहिए। Vivah Bazaar का <strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"382\">Dulha Car Package</strong> आपको देता है luxury cars aur premium rides का option, जिससे आपकी shaadi की shaan aur bhi बढ़ जाए। हमारी cars well-maintained, decorated aur comfortable होती हैं, ताकि आप apni baraat ki entry ekदम royal style me kar saken।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"641\">✨ <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"639\">इस पैकेज में आपको मिलेगा:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"697\">Dulha car booking सिर्फ ₹3,299 (Half Day + Fuel) से</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"769\">Wide range of cars &ndash; Scorpio, Bulero, Sedan, SUV aur luxury options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"809\">\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"809\">Well-maintained aur साफ-सुथरी गाड़ी</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"872\">सजावट (basic decoration included, customization available)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"927\">Professional driver aur time पर delivery की सुविधा</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1101\">चाहे baraat ki dhamakedaar entry हो, mandap तक का royal ride ya photo-shoot ke liye stylish car shots &ndash; हमारी dulha gadi services हर moment ko aur bhi grand bana देती है।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1156\">📌 <strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1154\">क्यों चुनें Vivah Bazaar Dulha Car Services?</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1195\">Affordable pricing सिर्फ ₹3,299 से</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1247\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1247\">Multiple car options (Budget se लेकर Luxury तक)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1286\">Well-maintained aur decorated cars</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1343\">Timely delivery aur client satisfaction की guarantee</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1454\">💍 आपकी shaadi ज़िंदगी का सबसे बड़ा celebration है, और dulha ki entry uska सबसे royal highlight होना चाहिए।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1521\">👉 अभी बुक करें और अपनी shaadi ki baraat को ek royal touch दें।</p>'),
