(141, 'Modules\\ServiceManagement\\Entities\\Service', 'e953d1cb-ca4d-4119-8ff7-4a1095a56b29', 'en', 'description', '<p data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"169\">💄 <strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"167\">Basic Makeup Service &ndash; Starting from ₹9,999</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"377\">हर दुल्हन का सपना होता है कि उसकी शादी के दिन वह सबसे सुंदर और आकर्षक दिखे। Vivah Bazaar का Basic Makeup Package आपको देता है <em data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"323\">natural aur elegant look</em>, ताकि आप शादी के दिन चमकें और हर नजर आप पर ठहर जाए।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"412\">✨ <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"410\">इस पैकेज में आपको मिलेगा:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<li data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"457\">\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"457\">Basic Bridal Makeup सिर्फ ₹9,999 से शुरू</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"521\">Professional makeup artist aur branded products का इस्तेमाल</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"563\">\r\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"563\">Natural look with long-lasting makeup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"608\">Hair styling aur basic accessories setup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"655\">\r\n<p data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"655\">Pre-makeup skin care aur touch-up facility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"713\">📌 <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"711\">क्यों चुनें Vivah Bazaar Basic Makeup Services?</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"912\">\r\n<li data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"752\">Affordable pricing सिर्फ ₹9,999 से</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"808\">Experienced makeup artists with professional skills</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n<p data-start=\"81